     "4^N ", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "770044e7-06df-4f7d-92c1-22161ba6e461"],
 "possible sequences - test this for N ",
