Cell["what counts as a \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]function\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] for our purposes?", \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990299186588814*^9, 
  3.9902992011204042`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ab58ac2c-729d-491d-baf6-\
f1507a523fc8"],

